    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Core Rulebook</i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are considered <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in a new <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill\">Skill</a>.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> Choose one <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Untrained_Skill\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Untrained Skill\">Untrained Skill</a> from your list of Class Skills. You become <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in that <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill\">Skill</a>.</p><p><b>Special:</b> This Feat may be selected multiple times. Each time you take this Feat, it applies to a different Class Skill.</p>",
